msgstr "Utilisation du dossier temporaire : {folder}"

#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:594
msgid "Writing EPANET input file"
msgstr "Ecriture du fichier d'entree EPANET"

#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:597
msgid "Run EPANET simulation"
msgstr "Execution de la simulation EPANET"

#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:603
msgid "Process results output file"
msgstr "Traitement du fichier de sortie des resultats"

#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:609
msgid "Creating output layers"
msgstr "Creation des couches de sortie"

#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:630
#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:647
msgid "Export Inp File"
msgstr "Exporter le fichier Inp"

#: gusnet/gusnet_processing/run_simulation.py:633
msgid ""
"\n"
"This will take all of the model layers (junctions, tanks, reservoirs, pipes, valves, pumps), combine them with the chosen options, and produce an EPANET '.inp' file which can be run / viewed in other software.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Cela prend toutes les couches du modele (jonctions, reservoirs, bassins, "
"conduites, vannes, pompes), les combine avec les options choisies, puis "
"genere un fichier EPANET '.inp' qui peut etre execute ou consulte dans "
"d'autres logiciels."

